        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sondeza kuwe uAroni lamadodana akhe abaphakathi kwabakoIsrayeli, ukuba babe ngabapristi bokuphatha umsebenzi wami, ngitsho uAroni lamadodana akhe uNadabi loAbihu loEleyazare loIthamari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.39.1+EXO.39.2+EXO.39.3+EXO.39.4+EXO.39.5+EXO.39.6+EXO.39.7+EXO.39.8+EXO.39.9+EXO.39.10+EXO.39.11+EXO.39.12+EXO.39.13+EXO.39.14+EXO.39.15+EXO.39.16+EXO.39.17+EXO.39.18+EXO.39.19+EXO.39.20+EXO.39.21+EXO.39.22+EXO.39.23+EXO.39.24+EXO.39.25+EXO.39.26+EXO.39.27+EXO.39.28+EXO.39.29+EXO.39.30+EXO.39.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 39:1–31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umenzele uAroni umfowenu izambatho ezingcwele, ezobukhosi lezokucecisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khuluma labo bonke abahlakaniphileyo engibagcwalise ngomoya wokuhlakanipha, ukuba benze izambatho zikaAroni zokumahlukanisela ubupristi ukuba angikhonze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yilezi izambatho abazakuzenza; ingubo yesifuba lengubo yamahlombe, lesigqoko, lebhatshi elilamabala, leqhiye, lebhanti; bamenzele uAroni umfowenu lamadodana akhe izambatho ezingcwele ukuba babe ngabapristi bokuphatha umsebenzi wami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabathathe ilembu legolide leliluhlaza leliyibubende lelibomvu, ilembu elihle, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bayenze ingubo yamahlombe ngelembu elihle lentambo ephothiweyo yegolide leluhlaza leyibubende lebomvu, kube ngumsebenzi wengcitshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izakuba lezichibi ezimbili zasemahlombe, zihlangane emaceleni ayo womabili, ukuba ihlanganiswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibhanti elalukiweyo elikuyo, elokuyibopha okhalweni, kalenziwe lifanane layo, ngelembu elihle lentambo ephothiweyo yegolide leluhlaza leyibubende lebomvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakuthatha amatshe amabili athiwa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ubhale kuwo amabizo amadodana kaIsrayeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amabizo awo ayisithupha abe kwelinye ilitshe, lamabizo ayisithupha aseleyo abe kwelinye njengokuzalwa kwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njengokubhala komkhandi wendandatho lawe uzawabhala amabizo amadodana kaIsrayeli ematsheni womabili, uwazingelezele ngezinto ezitshiliweyo zegolide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzathungela amatshe womabili ezichibini zengubo yamahlombe, ukuba abe ngamatshe esikhumbuzo ebantwaneni bakoIsrayeli; uAroni uzakuthwala amabizo abo emahlombe akhe phambi kweNkosi ukuba abe yisikhumbuzo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenze izinto ezitshiliweyo zegolide, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lamaketane amabili egolide elihle, uwenze ukuba abe njengamagoda aphothiweyo, amaketane uwabophele ezintweni ezitshiliweyo zegolide.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
