              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazakubophela amasongo engubo yesifuba emasongweni engubo yamahlombe ngentambo eluhlaza, ukuba ingubo yesifuba ibe phezu kwebhanti elalukiweyo, ingakhumuki engutsheni yamahlombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAroni uzakuthwala amabizo abantu bakoIsrayeli engutsheni yesifuba yokwahlulela phezu kwenhliziyo yakhe nxa engena endaweni engcwele, kube yisikhumbuzo phambi kweNkosi njalonjalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakufaka engutsheni yesifuba yokwahlulela inkatho iUrimi leThumimi, kube phezu kwenhliziyo kaAroni nxa engena phambi kweNkosi; ngakhoke uAroni uzakuthwala ukwahlulelwa kwabakoIsrayeli phezu kwenhliziyo yakhe phambi kweNkosi njalonjalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
